Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Every story has a silence.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏لكل قصة لحظة صمت.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Mine lasted longer than I planned.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏وصمتي طال أكثر مما خططت.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.50,0:00:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,The lights went out. The room went quiet.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.50,0:00:22.50,AR,,0,0,0,,‏انطفأت الأضواء، وسكنت الغرفة.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,But I never forgot where it started.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏لكنني لم أنسَ يومًا من أين بدأت.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Every video. Every late night. Every person who stayed.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.50,AR,,0,0,0,,‏كل مقطع، كل سهرة، وكل من بقي معي.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.00,0:00:45.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Time away doesn't end the journey.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.00,0:00:45.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏الابتعاد لا يعني نهاية الرحلة.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.50,0:00:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it's where you learn who you are.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.50,0:00:51.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏أحيانًا، فيه تكتشف من تكون.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.00,0:01:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Coming back isn't an announcement.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.00,0:01:00.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏العودة ليست مجرد إعلان.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It's a decision.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.00,AR,,0,0,0,,‏إنها قرار.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,And I've made mine.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.50,AR,,0,0,0,,‏وقد اتخذتُ قراري.‏
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.50,EN,,0,0,0,,A new chapter starts now.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.50,AR,,0,0,0,,‏والفصل الجديد يبدأ الآن.‏
